# DramaWay UI

Read `docs/design/system.md` before building a section, and `docs/design/figma-baseline.md` for any measured value. Do not call the Figma MCP for numbers that are already in those files.

The Figma file is a visual direction, not a spec: no auto-layout, no variables, no components, no mobile screens. Deviations from it are deliberate and listed in `system.md` — do not "fix" them back.

## Hard rules

- **No pixel values in `components/sections/*`.** Use tokens or the composition classes. Missing something? Add a class in `@layer components` in `globals.css` — never an arbitrary value like `mt-[137px]`.
- **Decorative circles are backgrounds, not elements.** The Figma dot band is 270 identical circles; `DotBand` draws it with `radial-gradient`.
- **Every section survives empty data.** Sanity fields are optional and galleries vary in length; Figma always shows a fixed count.
- **Headings are always uppercase** via `@layer base` on `h1–h4`. Do not add `uppercase` on each heading, and do not store ALL CAPS in CMS copy.

## What exists

Classes: `.page`, `.split` / `.split-text` / `.split-media` / `.split-reverse`, `.hero` / `.hero-title` / `.hero-copy` / `.hero-media`, `.site-header` / `.site-nav-overlay`, `.cols-3`, `.stack` / `.stack-item` / `.stack-narrow`, `.measure`.

Components: `layout/section.tsx`, `visual/dot-band.tsx`, `visual/palette-row.tsx`, `visual/blob.tsx`, `visual/cta-link.tsx`, `visual/media.tsx`.

Tokens: colours `sand` `ink` `green` `green-ink` `magenta` `navy` `brand-1…7`; fonts `font-display` `font-body`; sizes `text-display`/`text-h1` 48, `text-h2` 32 (band labels), `text-h3` 24 (section titles), `text-h4` 20 (card titles), `text-lead` 20 (hero + prose), `text-body` 18, `text-small` 14; rhythm `py-section`. Size class ≠ HTML tag: one H1, H2 per section, H3 for news cards.

```tsx
// BAD — hardcoded geometry, raw Figma green, no empty-state
<div style={{ marginLeft: 156 }}>
  <a className="text-[#369125]">poznaj nasze projekty</a>
  <img src={url} width={481} height={823} />
</div>

// GOOD
<Section bleed>
  <div className="split">
    <div className="split-text py-section">
      <h2 className="font-display text-h3 font-black">{title}</h2>
      {summary ? <p className="measure mt-8 text-body">{summary}</p> : null}
      {ctaLabel ? <CtaLink href={ctaHref}>{ctaLabel}</CtaLink> : null}
    </div>
    <Media image={image} alt={alt} variant="bleed" className="split-media" />
  </div>
</Section>
```
